-- MICHELIN's own town names (restaurant pages; for hotels, the hotel page's
-- locality, which is sometimes an area such as Jiuzhaigou or Shangrila, as for
-- GB and Spain; five district localities -- Tian He, Chaoyang, Dongcheng,
-- Pudong, Huangpu -- are written as the municipality MICHELIN's addressRegion
-- names). None exists in production's export, compared accent-, case-, space-
